            "title": "Gold and silver prices retreat: What consumers are seeing",
            "description": "<p>After hitting record highs recently, gold (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GC=F\">GC=F</a>) and silver prices (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/SI=F\">SI=F</a>) are beginning to slide. Yahoo Finance senior reporter <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/brooke-dipalma/\">Brooke DiPalma</a> joins the Opening Bid panel to discuss how consumers are noticing the trends within precious metal commodities, from wholesale retailer Costco (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/COST\">COST</a>) to Signet Jewelers (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/SIG\">SIG</a>).</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/opening-bid/\">Opening Bid</a>.</p>",
